{title: Is Dard-e-dil Ki Sifarish}
{artist: Mohammad Irfan Gajendra Verma Baarish}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] Dil mera hai nasamajh [F] kitna,        [Cm] Besabar ye bevakoof [Gm] bada
[Gm] Chahta hai kitna [F] tujhe,        [F] Khud magar nahi jaan [Gm] saka
[Gm] Is dard-e-dil ki sifaarish,        Ab [F] kar de koi yahaan
Ke [D#] mil jaye ise wo baarish,        Jo [D] bhiga de poori [Gm] tarah
[Gm] Is dard-e-dil ki sifarish,        Ab [F] kar de koi yahaan
Ke [D#] mil jaye ise wo baarish,        Jo [D] bhiga de poori [Gm] tarah
[Gm] Yaariyaan [F],        [Gm] Yaariyaan [F]
[Gm] Kya hua [Dm] asar tere,        [C] sath rehkar na jane
Ki [D#] hosh [F] mujhe na [Gm] raha,        [Gm] Lafz me [Dm] re
[C] zubaan pe aake ruke,        Par [D#] ho na [F] sake wo [Gm] bayaan
[D#] Dhadkan tera hi [F] naam jape,        [D#] Aankhein bhi [F] paigaam yeh de
[D#] Teri nazar ka yeh asar hai,        [D] mujhpe jo hua
[Gm] Is dard-e-dil ki sifaarish,        Ab [F] kar de koi yahaan
Ke [D#] mil jaye ise wo baarish,        Jo [D] bhiga de poori [Gm] tarah
[Gm] Is dard-e-dil ki sifaarish,        Ab [F] kar de koi yahaan
Ke [D#] mil jaye ise wo baarish,        Jo [D] bhiga de poori [Gm] tarah
[Gm] Tu jo [Dm] mila to,        [C] zindagi hai badli
Main [D#] poora [F] naya ho [Gm] gaya,        [Gm] Hain [Dm] be asar ye
[C] duniya ki baatein badi,        Ab [D#] teri [F] sunoon main [Gm] sada
Hmm [D#] milne ko tujhse [F] bahane karoon,        [D#] Tu muskuraaye [F] vajah main banoon
[D#] Roz bitana sath mein tere,        [D] sara din [D#] mera
[Gm] Is dard-e-dil ki sifaarish,        Ab [F] kar de koi yahaan
Ke [D#] mil jaye ise wo baarish,        Jo [D] bhiga de poori [Gm] tarah
